WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.640
Good evening, you came back again

00:00:05.675 --> 00:00:10.779
Ten or so of you online

00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:14.454
I know every one of your names

00:00:14.454 --> 00:00:18.000
Ten months now, you're always here

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.760
On stream I'm the nice guy

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:28.000
I call the plays, calm and cool

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.520
Then the stream goes off and it all comes out

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:36.000
I slam the desk: "Don't you ron-nya me!"

00:00:37.282 --> 00:00:39.563
Ten people watching

00:00:39.563 --> 00:00:41.829
My hand, East round one

00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:46.344
My wife and kids asleep upstairs

00:00:46.344 --> 00:00:51.000
And here I am, still live

00:00:55.385 --> 00:00:57.904
The AI does my job for me

00:00:57.904 --> 00:01:00.141
Slack and Jira, all the code

00:01:00.141 --> 00:01:02.390
So what'd I do with all that time?

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:04.280
Played mahjong till the dawn

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.861
In March I signed for a million bucks

00:01:06.861 --> 00:01:09.447
Two years to pay, they wanted it in one month

00:01:09.447 --> 00:01:11.509
The whole bill landed, and we ran dry

00:01:11.509 --> 00:01:14.103
I told my wife the rent's in doubt

00:01:14.103 --> 00:01:16.151
I bought imported ramen, twice

00:01:16.151 --> 00:01:18.398
Three, four times what it costs back home

00:01:18.398 --> 00:01:20.439
Still got the money for that

00:01:20.439 --> 00:01:23.000
Ate every bite, and I'm good

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:26.747
Ten people watching

00:01:26.747 --> 00:01:29.164
My hand, South round three

00:01:29.164 --> 00:01:33.671
My wife and kids asleep upstairs

00:01:33.671 --> 00:01:38.000
And here I am, still live

00:01:43.182 --> 00:01:47.000
I wrote the articles, I wrote the blog

00:01:47.781 --> 00:01:51.699
Sent the news out every Friday

00:01:51.699 --> 00:01:55.954
Hundreds of people read it all

00:01:55.954 --> 00:02:00.095
But every night it's back to ten

00:02:00.095 --> 00:02:04.907
Mid-stream my daughter climbs onto my lap

00:02:04.907 --> 00:02:09.062
There were a few nights like that

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:14.004
Win, and "Nice one!" goes out to the world

00:02:14.004 --> 00:02:18.680
Lose, and "You suck!" — no mercy at all

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:20.694
Ten people watching

00:02:20.694 --> 00:02:23.018
But tonight I'm not going live

00:02:23.018 --> 00:02:27.633
Twenty-one years, October fourth

00:02:27.633 --> 00:02:32.000
I'm heading up the stairs
